<title>USA: Glens Falls CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Glens Falls CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $8.500 million of Glens Falls CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.67 percent.</p>
</text>
